00:32:49.320 --> 00:32:53.070
to trace back exactly
what led to the crash,

00:32:53.070 --> 00:32:56.040
or my documentary about
the Bin Laden raid,

00:32:56.040 --> 00:32:58.050
where I mapped out exactly

00:32:58.050 --> 00:33:00.540
what happened when a US Seal team

00:33:00.540 --> 00:33:03.345
stormed the compound
of the Al-Qaeda leader.

00:33:03.345 --> 00:33:04.470
(intense music continues)

00:33:04.470 --> 00:33:06.600
These are videos that are not made

